sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Data Scientist
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Controller as odh-model-controller<br/>9443/TCP Webhook<br/>8080/TCP Metrics
    participant NGCAPI as NVIDIA NGC API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant NVCR as nvcr.io Registry<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Dashboard as RHOAI Dashboard
    participant APIServer as model-serving-api<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS (FIPS)

    Note over User,NVCR: Flow 1: InferenceService Reconciliation
    User->>K8sAPI: kubectl apply InferenceService
    K8sAPI->>Controller: Watch event (HTTPS/TLS 1.2+)
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create OpenShift Route<br/>(Reencrypt or Edge TLS)
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create Service,<br/>ServiceMonitor, ConfigMap
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create ClusterRoleBinding<br/>(auth-delegator)
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create KEDA TriggerAuth<br/>(if autoscaling enabled)

    Note over User,NVCR: Flow 2: LLMInferenceService Auth Bootstrap
    User->>K8sAPI: kubectl apply LLMInferenceService
    K8sAPI->>Controller: Watch event (HTTPS/TLS 1.2+)
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create AuthPolicy<br/>targeting HTTPRoute
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create EnvoyFilter<br/>(Authorino TLS cluster)
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create AuthPolicy on Gateway<br/>(KubernetesTokenReview)
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create PodMonitor<br/>(Istio/Envoy metrics)

    Note over User,NVCR: Flow 3: NIM Account Lifecycle
    User->>K8sAPI: kubectl apply NIM Account
    K8sAPI->>Controller: Watch event (HTTPS/TLS 1.2+)
    Controller->>NGCAPI: Validate API Key<br/>(API Key header, HTTPS)
    NGCAPI-->>Controller: Validation Result
    Controller->>NGCAPI: Fetch NIM Model Data<br/>(Bearer Token, HTTPS)
    NGCAPI-->>Controller: Model Metadata
    Controller->>NVCR: Validate via Manifest Pull<br/>(Bearer Token/OAuth)
    NVCR-->>Controller: Manifest OK
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create ConfigMap (model data),<br/>Secret (pull creds),<br/>Template (ServingRuntime)

    Note over Dashboard,APIServer: Flow 4: Gateway Discovery
    Dashboard->>APIServer: GET /api/v1/gateways<br/>Bearer Token, HTTPS/TLS 1.2+ (FIPS)
    APIServer->>K8sAPI: SelfSubjectAccessReview<br/>(User's Bearer Token)
    K8sAPI-->>APIServer: Authorized namespaces
    APIServer->>K8sAPI: List Gateways<br/>(SA Token)
    K8sAPI-->>APIServer: Gateway list
    APIServer-->>Dashboard: Filtered gateway list<br/>(RBAC-scoped)

    Note over User,NVCR: Webhook Flows (Admission)
    User->>K8sAPI: kubectl apply InferenceService/Pod
    K8sAPI->>Controller: AdmissionReview (HTTPS/9443)
    Note right of Controller: Inject: S3 creds,<br/>HardwareProfile,<br/>Ray TLS volumes
    Controller-->>K8sAPI: AdmissionResponse (mutated)
